  27:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****                       ##### DAC Peripheral features #####
  28:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****   ==============================================================================
  29:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  30:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Channels ***
ARM GAS   			page 2


  31:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       ====================
  32:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  33:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     STM32G4 devices integrate up to seven 12-bit Digital Analog Converters,
  34:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     up to six of them grouped by pair forming a DAC instance.
  35:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  36:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     The 2 converters of an single instance (i.e. channel1 & channel2)
  37:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     can be used independently or simultaneously (dual mode):
  38:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC channel1 with DAC_OUT1 as output (not for all) or connected to on-chip
  39:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           peripherals (ex. comparators, operational amplifier).
  40:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC channel2 with DAC_OUT2 as output (not for all) or connected to on-chip
  41:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           peripherals (ex. comparators, operational amplifier).
  42:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Note: when an instance only includes one converter, only independent mode is
  43:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         supported by this converter.
  44:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  45:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     STM32G4 instances & converters availability and output PIO mapping (DAC_OUTx):
  46:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  47:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****                            |    DAC1    |    DAC2    |    DAC3    |    DAC4    |
  48:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  49:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Channel 1  |           |    YES     |    YES     |    YES     |    YES
  50:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****                | DAC_OUT1  |    PA4     |    PA6     |     -      |     -
  51:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  52:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Channel 2  |           |    YES     |    NO      |    YES     |    YES
  53:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****                | DAC_OUT2  |    PA5     |     -      |     -      |     -
  54:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  55:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Note: On this STM32 series, all devices do not include each DAC instances listed
  56:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           above. Refer to device datasheet for DACx instance availability.
  57:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  58:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Triggers ***
  59:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       ====================
  60:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  61:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be non-triggered using DAC_TRIGGER_NONE
  62:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     and DAC_OUT1/DAC_OUT2 is available once writing to DHRx register.
  63:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  64:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be triggered by:
  65:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) External event: EXTI Line 9 (any GPIOx_PIN_9) using DAC_TRIGGER_EXT_IT9.
  66:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           The used pin (GPIOx_PIN_9) must be configured in input mode.
  67:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  68:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Timers TRGO: TIM1, TIM2, TIM3, TIM4, TIM6, TIM7, TIM8 and TIM15
  69:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           (DAC_TRIGGER_T2_TRGO, DAC_TRIGGER_T3_TRGO...)
  70:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  71:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Software using DAC_TRIGGER_SOFTWARE
  72:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  73:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) HRTimer TRGO: HRTIM1 (1)
  74:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           (DAC_TRIGGER_HRTIM_TRG01, DAC_TRIGGER_HRTIM_TRG02...)
  75:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  76:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  77:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     Specific triggers for sawtooth generation:
  78:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) External event: EXTI Line 10 (any GPIOx_PIN_10) using DAC_TRIGGER_EXT_IT10.
  79:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           The used pin (GPIOx_PIN_10) must be configured in input mode.
  80:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  81:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) HRTimer Step & Reset: HRTIM1 (1)
  82:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           (DAC_TRIGGER_HRTIM_RST_TRG1, DAC_TRIGGER_HRTIM_STEP_TRG1...)
  83:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  84:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Note: On this STM32 series, parameter only available if HRTIM feature is
  85:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****             supported (refer to device datasheet for supported features list)
  86:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  87:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Buffer mode feature ***
ARM GAS   			page 3


  88:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       ===============================
  89:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  90:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Each DAC channel integrates an output buffer that can be used to
  91:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       reduce the output impedance, and to drive external loads directly
  92:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       without having to add an external operational amplifier.
  93:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       To enable, the output buffer use
  94:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_OutputBuffer = DAC_OUTPUTBUFFER_ENABLE;
  95:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  96:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (@) Refer to the device datasheet for more details about output
  97:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           impedance value with and without output buffer.
  98:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  99:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC connect feature ***
 100:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       ===============================
 101:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
 102:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Each DAC channel can be connected internally.
 103:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       To connect, use
 104:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_ConnectOnChipPeripheral = DAC_CHIPCONNECT_INTERNAL;
 105:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       or
 106:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_ConnectOnChipPeripheral = DAC_CHIPCONNECT_BOTH; (caution: dependence to other par
 107:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       refer to literal description).
 108:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 109:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** GPIO configurations guidelines ***
 110:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       =====================
 111:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
 112:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       When a DAC channel is used (ex channel1 on PA4) and the other is not
 113:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (ex channel2 on PA5 is configured in Analog and disabled).
 114:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Channel1 may disturb channel2 as coupling effect.
 115:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Note that there is no coupling on channel2 as soon as channel2 is turned on.
 116:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Coupling on adjacent channel could be avoided as follows:
 117:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       when unused PA5 is configured as INPUT PULL-UP or DOWN.
 118:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       PA5 is configured in ANALOG just before it is turned on.
 119:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 120:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Sample and Hold feature ***
 121:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       ========================
 122:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
 123:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       For each converter, 2 modes are supported: normal mode and
 124:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       "sample and hold" mode (i.e. low power mode).
 125:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       In the sample and hold mode, the DAC core converts data, then holds the
 126:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       converted voltage on a capacitor. When not converting, the DAC cores and
 127:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       buffer are completely turned off between samples and the DAC output is
 128:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       tri-stated, therefore  reducing the overall power consumption. A new
 129:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       stabilization period is needed before each new conversion.
 130:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 131:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       The sample and hold allow setting internal or external voltage @
 132:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       low power consumption cost (output value can be at any given rate either
 133:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       by CPU or DMA).
 134:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 135:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       The Sample and hold block and registers uses either LSI & run in
 136:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       several power modes: run mode, sleep mode, low power run, low power sleep
 137:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       mode & stop1 mode.
 138:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 139:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Low power stop1 mode allows only static conversion.
 140:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 141:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       To enable Sample and Hold mode
 142:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Enable LSI using HAL_RCC_OscConfig with RCC_OSCILLATORTYPE_LSI &
 143:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       RCC_LSI_ON parameters.
 144:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
ARM GAS   			page 4


 145:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       Use DAC_InitStructure.DAC_SampleAndHold = DAC_SAMPLEANDHOLD_ENABLE;
 146:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          & DAC_ChannelConfTypeDef.DAC_SampleAndHoldConfig.DAC_SampleTime,
 147:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****            DAC_HoldTime & DAC_RefreshTime;
 148:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 149:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC calibration feature ***
 150:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        ===================================
 151:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
 152:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (#)  The 2 converters (channel1 & channel2) provide calibration capabilities.
 153:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (++) Calibration aims at correcting some offset of output buffer.
 154:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (++) The DAC uses either factory calibration settings OR user defined
 155:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****            calibration (trimming) settings (i.e. trimming mode).
 156:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (++) The user defined settings can be figured out using self calibration
 157:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****            handled by HAL_DACEx_SelfCalibrate.
 158:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (++) HAL_DACEx_SelfCalibrate:
 159:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+++) Runs automatically the calibration.
 160:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+++) Enables the user trimming mode
 161:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+++) Updates a structure with trimming values with fresh calibration
 162:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****             results.
 163:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****             The user may store the calibration results for larger
 164:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****             (ex monitoring the trimming as a function of temperature
 165:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****             for instance)
 166:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 167:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC wave generation feature ***
 168:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        ===================================
 169:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 170:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        Both DAC channels can be used to generate
 171:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Noise wave
 172:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Triangle wave
 173:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Sawtooth wave
 174:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 175:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data format ***
 176:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        =======================
 177:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 178:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        The DAC data format can be:
 179:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 8-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_8B_R
 180:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit left alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_L
 181:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_R
 182:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 183:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data value to voltage correspondence ***
 184:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        ================================================
 185:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 186:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        The analog output voltage on each DAC channel pin is determined
 187:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        by the following equation:
 188:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 189:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        DAC_OUTx = VREF+ * DOR / 4095
 190:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) with  DOR is the Data Output Register
 191:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 192:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           VREF+ is the input voltage reference (refer to the device datasheet)
 193:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 194:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         e.g. To set DAC_OUT1 to 0.7V, use
 195:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Assuming that VREF+ = 3.3V, DAC_OUT1 = (3.3 * 868) / 4095 = 0.7V
 196:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 197:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DMA requests ***
 198:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        =====================
 199:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 200:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        A DMAMUX request can be generated when an external trigger (but not a software trigger)
 201:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        occurs if DMAMUX requests are enabled using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA().
ARM GAS   			page 5


 202:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        DMAMUX requests are mapped as following:
 203:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 204:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****                                |    DAC1    |    DAC2    |    DAC3    |    DAC4    |
 205:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 206:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         Channel 1  |           |     6      |     41     |    102     |    104
 207:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 208:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         Channel 2  |           |     7      |     -      |    103     |    105
 209:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 210:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         Note: On this STM32 series, all devices do not include each DAC instances listed
 211:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****               above. Refer to device datasheet for DACx instance availability.
 212:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 213:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** High frequency interface mode ***
 214:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        =====================================
 215:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 216:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        The high frequency interface informs DAC instance about the bus frequency in use.
 217:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        It is mandatory information for DAC (as internal timing of DAC is bus frequency dependent)
 218:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        provided thanks to parameter DAC_HighFrequency handled in HAL_DAC_ConfigChannel () function.
 219:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        Use of DAC_HIGH_FREQUENCY_INTERFACE_MODE_AUTOMATIC value of DAC_HighFrequency is recommended
 220:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        function figured out the correct setting.
 221:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        The high frequency mode is same for all converters of a same DAC instance. Either same
 222:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        parameter DAC_HighFrequency is used for all DAC converters or again self
 223:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        DAC_HIGH_FREQUENCY_INTERFACE_MODE_AUTOMATIC detection parameter.
 224:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 225:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]
 226:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****     (@) For Dual mode and specific signal (Sawtooth, triangle and noise) generation
 227:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****         please refer to Extended Features Driver description
 228:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c **** 
