 233:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****           registers using HAL_DAC_Init()
 234:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) If available & needed, configure DAC_OUTx (DAC_OUT1, DAC_OUT2) in analog mode.
