 255:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA(), at this stage the user specify the l
 256:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****            of data to be transferred at each end of conversion
 257:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dac.c ****            First issued trigger will start the conversion of the value previously set by HAL_DAC_Se
